      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I found when I first launched this update I had to go into my steamvr controller bindings to reset my joystick deadzones as for some reason they were set but were not working. Thats about the only help I can give for that issue beyond getting a new controller. As for the other feedback thats all valid and good points to consider.",
